    "detailed_description": "<strong><i>PIPELINE RTX</i></strong> is a strategic puzzle game. The goal of the game is impossibly simple: you need to turn the various parts of the pipe into certain positions, so that in the end the water can, albeit with a large number of meanders, but pass through the water supply.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902750/extras/5d568c5af77696d7901ce6e7cd8aeeee.avif?t=1710403400\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What's in the game:</h2>- various levels, sometimes with obstacles on the way<br>- high quality graphics, such that not every retired plumber would distinguish from real life<br>- variability of passing levels, it is not necessary to do what is intended<br>- fluidity of water through pipes (this makes it easier to understand that a particular pipe is connected or not connected to the water supply)<br><br>In general, go for it, have fun and invite your grandfather to play! He will definitely get such an understandable and vital gameplay)",
